-We'll find out later, yeah?

616
00:28:28,790 --> 00:28:30,918
-I… took up a part-time job.
-[Umi] Right?

617
00:28:31,001 --> 00:28:32,502
-[Shizu] That's cool.
-[Umi] A part-time job?

618
00:28:32,586 --> 00:28:34,671
