then I feel really terrible.

619
00:28:34,755 --> 00:28:35,756
-Over here, yeah?
-Yep.

620
00:28:35,839 --> 00:28:36,882
-Come this way, please.
-Oh, okay.

621
00:28:36,965 --> 00:28:38,258
-You went on a journey, huh?
-This is cool!

622
00:28:38,926 --> 00:28:39,927
