a pack of lions is also called a pride.

637
00:29:09,748 --> 00:29:11,667
-It can mean "brotherhood."
-Eh!

638
00:29:12,334 --> 00:29:13,627
Is this your message for me?

639
00:29:13,710 --> 00:29:15,212
-[Noel] It is.
-Whoo!

640
00:29:15,295 --> 00:29:17,673
-Here.
-He says, "Here."

641
00:29:17,756 --> 00:29:18,840
Mine says, "Dream."

642
00:29:18,924 --> 00:29:20,217
-[Noel] That's right.
-[Shizu] "Dream"?

643
00:29:20,300 --> 00:29:21,718
[Umi] Yeah.

644
00:29:21,802 --> 00:29:24,262
