dreaming big, Kaito.

645
00:29:25,180 --> 00:29:27,140
-I get it. These are your messages for us.
-You got it.

646
00:29:27,224 --> 00:29:29,142
-[Shizu] Chaka-chan, what does yours say?
-Mine says…

647
00:29:29,643 --> 00:29:31,979
-"Believe."
-[Shizu] Isn't that wonderful.

648
00:29:32,521 --> 00:29:34,564
[Noel] Chaka never stops believing in us.

649
00:29:34,648 --> 00:29:36,817
-[Umi] These messages…
-Are these your messages for us?

650
00:29:36,900 --> 00:29:38,151
[Noel] Yes, that's right.

651
00:29:38,235 --> 00:29:39,528
-You carved them.
-This is so sweet.

652
00:29:39,611 --> 00:29:41,279
