668
00:30:18,400 --> 00:30:20,944
Oh, yay, Noel.

669
00:30:21,028 --> 00:30:23,488
Oh, yeah!

670
00:30:23,572 --> 00:30:25,032
Yeah! Oh, yeah!

671
