I'm so happy to see you guys!

674
00:30:32,748 --> 00:30:35,083
-This is wonderful.
-Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah!

675
00:30:35,167 --> 00:30:37,252
-Feels like I haven't seen you for a year!
-It's been a while, folks!

676
00:30:37,335 --> 00:30:39,004
-Nice, nice.
-It's been forever!

677
00:30:39,087 --> 00:30:42,007
